  "title": "Vibrant Herbal Filipino Flaxseed Sisig",
  "description": "A festive Filipino dish featuring flaxseed, this sisig is a shattering, herbal delight that is Jain-friendly. It is boiled to perfection and served with a variety of flavors.",
