  "instructions": [
    "Boil the flaxseed in water for 10 minutes or until it is soft and shattering.",
    "Drain the water and let the flaxseed cool.",
    "In a pan, heat some oil and saute the chopped onion until it is translucent.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced chili peppers and cook for another minute.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked flaxseed, sauteed onion and ginger, lemon juice, soy sauce, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Mix well and garnish with chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Refrigerate any leftovers for up to 3 days."
